Upstream attribution
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Mihon (https://github.com/mihonapp/mihon), and Tachiyomi
(https://github.com/tachiyomiorg/tachiyomi) before it, are licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. A copy of that license is available at:

    http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

The following parts of this project are derived from, or designed for
compatibility with, that upstream work:

  * The extension source API contract reproduced in `bridge/src/main/kotlin/`
    (`Source`, `CatalogueSource`, `HttpSource`, `SManga`, `SChapter`, `Page`,
    `Filter`, `FilterList`, `MangasPage`) so that unmodified Tachiyomi and
    Mihon extension APKs can be loaded and executed.

  * The Android platform stubs under `bridge/src/main/kotlin/android/`, which
    exist only to satisfy the Android APIs those extensions link against.

  * The `.tachibk` backup schema implemented in
    `mihon/core/tachibk_importer.py` and `mihon/core/tachibk_exporter.py`,
    which mirrors Mihon's protobuf field numbering so that backups can be
    moved between Android Mihon and this application in both directions.

  * The source id derivation in `mihon/core/tachibk_exporter.py`, which
    reproduces Tachiyomi's `HttpSource.id` hash so that exported backups
    resolve to the correct extension on Android.

  * The Cloudflare interceptor and rate-limit interceptor behavior in
    `bridge/src/main/kotlin/eu/kanade/tachiyomi/network/`.

This project is not endorsed by, affiliated with, or supported by the Mihon or
Tachiyomi projects or their contributors.

